d had an emotional connection.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"government","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_11","text":"Actually,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"government","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_12","text":"I didn't think she'd run away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"government","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_13","text":"She was the type that tried her best, no matter how incompetent she might be.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"government","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_14","text":"I can't figure out why she'd run away so suddenly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"government","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_15","text":"Anyway, now that I know she's still alive,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"government","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_16","text":"I can always ask her why when I see her next time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"government","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_17","text":"Now, I just need to figure out what to do next.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"government","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_18","text":"When I do, may I ask for your help again?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_19","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"government","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_20","text":"Thank you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1042_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"government","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1042_e_21","text":"Until next time.","jump":null}],"chat":true}